{"timestamp":"2026-11-04T02:19:41.360Z","ordinal":412,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a19ecc-82f0-7492-9f12-a328e4f8c843","turn_id":"01a1a45a-c6f8-72b0-9a86-ecf0c49189ff","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_080347deb607e55e016aea9638eaf4819b89c787ddc6478ecf","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"No. **`git push` doesn’t join histories at all.** It uploads your local commits and moves the remote branch pointer to your local tip. If the histories have diverged, a normal push is rejected. You merge or rebase locally, then push.\n\nYour desired Sun behavior is different, but possible: `git push` would upload Sun objects and create a joined Sun history **on the remote branch only**, leaving your local Sun branch unchanged.\n\nWe could construct that join locally for upload without moving your local Sun branch pointer. A later `sun pull` would bring the joined history into your local branch."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1793758776929,"completed_at_ms":1793758781360}}
{"timestamp":"2026-11-04T02:19:41.362Z","ordinal":413,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_080347deb607e55e016aea9638eaf4819b89c787ddc6478ecf","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"No. **`git push` doesn’t join histories at all.** It uploads your local commits and moves the remote branch pointer to your local tip. If the histories have diverged, a normal push is rejected. You merge or rebase locally, then push.\n\nYour desired Sun behavior is different, but possible: `git push` would upload Sun objects and create a joined Sun history **on the remote branch only**, leaving your local Sun branch unchanged.\n\nWe could construct that join locally for upload without moving your local Sun branch pointer. A later `sun pull` would bring the joined history into your local branch.","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1a45a-c6f8-72b0-9a86-ecf0c49189ff","create_time":1793758776.9264863,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_080347deb607e55e016aea9638eaf4819b89c787ddc6478ecf","turn_id":"01a1a45a-c6f8-72b0-9a86-ecf0c49189ff","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a1a45a-dfb2-77f3-a114-bb29d407b218","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":41}}
